  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 12.27,
      "e": 17.67,
      "text": "This is shuttle launch control at T minus three hours and holding."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.67,
      "e": 25.79,
      "text": "The astronaut prime crew is presently in the breakfast room and prepared for breakfast."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.79,
      "e": 38.51,
      "text": "At the head table is the pilot Carol Bobco, sitting beside Dr. Story Musgrave, commander"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.51,
      "e": 47.42,
      "text": "PJ White's, Paul White's, and mission specialist Donald Peterson."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.42,
      "e": 53.58,
      "text": "Having the crew this morning for a launch are some of the support astronauts, James Van"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.58,
      "e": 64.38,
      "text": "Houghton and Woody Spring Anna Fisher, Kathy Sullivan, Sally Ride, who will be on the STS-7"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.38,
      "e": 70.94,
      "text": "mission is also present."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.94,
      "e": 77.18,
      "text": "This is shuttle launch control, T minus two hours, 36 minutes, 38 seconds, and counting."
    },
    {
      "s": 77.18,
      "e": 82.94,
      "text": "The flight crew is just in the process of leaving the crew quarters in the ONC building"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.94,
      "e": 88.94,
      "text": "and is in the elevator ready to go down to the first floor with the exception of Story"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.94,
      "e": 95.22,
      "text": "Musgrave, who has just run into the elevator and been greeted by Don Peterson, the other"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.22,
      "e": 97.3,
      "text": "mission specialist."
    },
    {
      "s": 97.3,
      "e": 103.14,
      "text": "John Young among the group and they're just about to close the door and will be on their"
    },
    {
      "s": 103.14,
      "e": 108.1,
      "text": "way to the ground floor and the Astro Van which will take them to the pad."
    },
    {
      "s": 108.1,
      "e": 115.86,
      "text": "They're on their way now out of the door of the OMC building and they're Paul White's"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.86,
      "e": 121.7,
      "text": "waving to the crew entering the Astro Van along with the mission specialist."
    },
    {
      "s": 121.7,
      "e": 130.38,
      "text": "Carol Bobco went over and shook hands with somebody who wished him well on their trip."
    },
    {
      "s": 130.38,
      "e": 140.58,
      "text": "The van being closed up by the security chief for this particular job, Gene String, and they're"
    },
    {
      "s": 140.58,
      "e": 149.74,
      "text": "on their way to the pad and they launch on time at 1.30pm Eastern Standard Time this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "s": 149.74,
      "e": 156.22,
      "text": "This has been an exceptionally smooth countdown ever since it picked up, a 93-hour countdown"
    },
    {
      "s": 156.22,
      "e": 164.7,
      "text": "which was picked up on Wednesday afternoon and proceeded up to Saturday night at midnight."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.7,
      "e": 171.02,
      "text": "There was a 24-hour 10-minute hold over Easter Sunday and then it was picked up at 10 minutes"
    },
    {
      "s": 171.02,
      "e": 176.9,
      "text": "after 12 this morning and has been proceeding smoothly ever since."
    },
    {
      "s": 176.9,
      "e": 184.82,
      "text": "The only concern has been a weather concern and there is continuing analysis of weather"
    },
    {
      "s": 184.82,
      "e": 196.15,
      "text": "balloon data which we should probably receive about the T-minus 50-minute point in the process"
    },
    {
      "s": 196.15,
      "e": 204.95,
      "text": "of putting on his Snoopy hat and his launch and entry helmet which is a hinged helmet that"
    },
    {
      "s": 204.95,
      "e": 213.27,
      "text": "is placed in place and then locked around the neck and makes a seal for the launch and entry"
    },
    {
      "s": 213.27,
      "e": 227.5,
      "text": "to provide both communications and life support functions."
    },
    {
      "s": 227.5,
      "e": 229.62,
      "text": "Everything going smoothly in the countdown."
    },
    {
      "s": 229.62,
